omx-contract (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: the shared declarations the FreeMixer DSP library needs
    (value ranges, defaults, kernel constants, sample rates and plugin
    parameter choices), as JSON data with a JSON Schema and as C headers. The
    headers match the ones omx-dsp 0.1.3 shipped, unit for unit.

